    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classscc_1_1ticking__clock" kindref="compound">ticking_clock</ref> class is a mixin that provides ticking clock functionality. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classscc_1_1ticking__clock" kindref="compound">ticking_clock</ref> class is a template class that inherits from a base class. It adds ticking clock functionality to the base class by monitoring an input clock signal.</para>
